      }
    },
    "Blend's rate history couldn't be loaded. Retrying every 30 seconds." : {
      "comment" : "Stellar Earn's chart view, in place of the chart: the market's rate history couldn't be read; DyorHQ tries again by itself. Blend is a protocol's name, never translated",
